      "instruction": "Sign in to Odoo with username 'admin' and password 'admin' (submit the login form). Then, in the Sales app, create a new customer/contact named exactly '{{runid}} Bench Customer' with City set to 'Benchville' (fill the Address block's City field; leave other address fields like Street empty unless required). Save the contact and verify the name and City are shown on the saved record. Report the customer name and city you see after saving. Do not wait for network idle - the app long-polls; wait for concrete page state instead.",
      "skill": "s_c760e8",
      "params": {
        "v2": "{{runid}} Bench Customer",
        "v3": "Benchville",
        "v1": "{{runid}}"
      },
