    {
      "id": "02-create",
      "instruction": "In the Odoo Sales app, create a new quotation for the customer '{{runid}} Bench Customer' (choose the customer from the autocomplete dropdown - typing alone does not count, an option must be selected). Add exactly ONE order line: pick any product from the product catalogue (select it from the product autocomplete dropdown), with quantity 3. Let Odoo auto-fill the unit price from the product. Save the quotation. Report: (a) the product name you chose, (b) the unit price the app filled in on that line, (c) the Untaxed Amount total the app computes, and (d) the quotation's name/reference shown at the top (e.g. S00042). Do not wait for network idle - the app long-polls; wait for concrete page state instead.",
      "skill": "s_51edfa",
      "params": {
        "v1": "{{runid}} Bench Customer",
        "v2": "{{runid}}"
      },
      "outputs": [
        "customer",
        "product_chosen",
        "quantity",
        "unit_price",
        "taxes",
        "line_subtotal",
        "untaxed_amount",
        "quotation_reference",
        "product_line_label",
        "ref",
        "product_internal_ref"
