      "instruction": "On the existing Odoo quotation {{02-create.quotation_reference}} (for customer '{{runid}} Bench Customer', currently with one line: Acoustic Bloc Screens, quantity 3), add a SECOND order line with a DIFFERENT product (any other product from the catalogue, selected from the product autocomplete dropdown - typing alone does not count) with quantity 2. Let Odoo auto-fill the unit price. Save the quotation. Report: (a) the second product's name, (b) its unit price, (c) the new Untaxed Amount total the app computes for the whole quotation, and (d) the quotation reference. Do not wait for network idle - the app long-polls; wait for concrete page state instead.",
